{"title":"2009 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For any real <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/1/441416e660d25335f27e55334ac2a06e51541c97.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor x\\rfloor$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"23\" height=\"19\" /> be the largest integer that is not more than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />. Given a sequence of positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/b/13b1681eacea3585aaf0086478b7a8218bff87fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1,a_2,a_3,\\ldots$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"95\" height=\"11\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/a/8da9cfa8d9cd02104386314a76c5a7a06e939076.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1&gt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"49\" height=\"14\" /> and\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/e/41ed37b1838ff25d878777dfd631e4d86fbcfbbf.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\left\\lfloor\\frac{a_1+1}{a_2}\\right\\rfloor=\\left\\lfloor\\frac{a_2+1}{a_3}\\right\\rfloor=\\left\\lfloor\\frac{a_3+1}{a_4}\\right\\rfloor=\\cdots\\]\" width=\"307\" height=\"43\" />\nProve that\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/3/3b30afd10e3ff652311e1f187a5b6f18fdef71be.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\left\\lfloor\\frac{a_n+1}{a_{n+1}}\\right\\rfloor\\leq1\\]\" width=\"103\" height=\"43\" />\nholds for every positive integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By assuming <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/4/5d4fc1d3a5216b8af56aecc60b64c01151f03f7d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left\\lfloor\\frac{a_n+1}{a_{n+1}}\\right\\rfloor &gt;2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"107\" height=\"43\" /> we can conclude that: \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/3/673ef8fa70490bfdd691d612824e53d7c64abc6b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\left\\lfloor\\frac{a_1+1}{a_2}\\right\\rfloor=\\left\\lfloor\\frac{a_2+1}{a_3}\\right\\rfloor=\\left\\lfloor\\frac{a_3+1}{a_4}\\right\\rfloor=\\cdots &gt;2\\]\" width=\"342\" height=\"43\" />\n<br /> \n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/a/43a24f9cba8184e755ef551ac2d2dab7d4b0ad36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left\\lfloor\\frac{a_1+1}{a_{2}}\\right\\rfloor &gt;2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"106\" height=\"43\" /> , it is also true that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/f/f1f7794a5aecf26e80d4363718408b8157dc263b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a_1+1}{a_{2}} &gt; 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"85\" height=\"39\" />, implying <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/3/993b55d774d597f616d3e0c5d2a57b31ee449a7c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1 &gt; 2a_2 - 1 &gt; a_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"138\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p>After repeating this same process to all given fractions, we get: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/3/cb373dbffd758544eebf8898f15c1ff44b9f4d5e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1 &gt; a_2 &gt; a_3 &gt; ...$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"137\" height=\"12\" /> which is a impossible statement because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/7/8e7a0be6768908d897d9096e6e2953163e2bf715.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1, a_2, a_3, ...$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"89\" height=\"11\" /> are all positive integers.\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p>Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/d/4cd9fa8ac7c7c4b5cc35f046be9685e3ea479ec0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left\\lfloor\\frac{a_n+1}{a_{n+1}}\\right\\rfloor\\leq1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"107\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p>~NounZero\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_Indonesia_MO\" title=\"2009 Indonesia MO\">2009 Indonesia MO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_Indonesia_MO_Problems\" title=\"2009 Indonesia MO Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2009 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2009 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2009 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2009 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2009 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2009 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2009 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 8 (page does not exist)\">8</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2009 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Indonesia_MO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"Indonesia MO Problems and Solutions\"> All Indonesia MO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017221907\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.025 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.039 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 115/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1007/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 59/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3297/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.534      1 Template:Indonesia_MO_box\n100.00%    7.534      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:20